{"2768300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCP", "steam_appid": 2768300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord Server!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/f37d483dfc532c3e24ba85915093699f.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/f37d483dfc532c3e24ba85915093699f.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/f37d483dfc532c3e24ba85915093699f.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community!<br>You can find the link at the <strong>details tab</strong> and <strong>community posts</strong>!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/087a5e56bdba3a17ed84c821f3dce366.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An SCP containment facility has fallen. Anomalies roam free, reality fractures, and every second drags you deeper into the unknown. You and your team are the last barrier between the outbreak and the outside world.. if you make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/8b8938ce70d85159a77ed9038b58407c.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/8b8938ce70d85159a77ed9038b58407c.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/8b8938ce70d85159a77ed9038b58407c.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/6d01c13330f04a44ec78f131d8815514.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your gear, steel your nerves, and descend into a nightmare that shifts every time you enter. The deeper you push, the richer the rewards… and the greater the risk.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/86f6f7d82f86a18271f4d4abd3732b18.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/86f6f7d82f86a18271f4d4abd3732b18.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/86f6f7d82f86a18271f4d4abd3732b18.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/bf04e66a16f0dc2103739fba340675c6.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run solo for precision and stealth, or bring 2–3 teammates to watch your back. Every firefight is loud enough to wake things you’d rather not meet. Every decision, engage or evade could mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/ce71e89124b4c856b59a505384d87b61.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/ce71e89124b4c856b59a505384d87b61.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/ce71e89124b4c856b59a505384d87b61.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/e55a059f46cc471d431cde1aa55cc039.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, SCP: Outbreak blends surreal brutalist architecture with realistic bodycam-style gunplay. Every bullet has weight. Every wall can crumble. Every shadow could hide something watching.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/afcbc3a98bd4d94c11b4b7eb5e1d4d50.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/afcbc3a98bd4d94c11b4b7eb5e1d4d50.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/afcbc3a98bd4d94c11b4b7eb5e1d4d50.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/854ddaa0a66660d81eefac6f35921014.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, extract, and expand your base to unlock new gear, research SCP artifacts, and prepare for even deadlier missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/685d86c39687b32dbfdb4029ec368344.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/685d86c39687b32dbfdb4029ec368344.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/685d86c39687b32dbfdb4029ec368344.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/2f0fe9b37553e0a3f1cbc402d0c53303.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From entities that stalk you in silence to phenomena that twist space itself, no encounter plays out the same way twice. Observe, adapt, or be consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently known SCPs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-049</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-087</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-096</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-106</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-173</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-294</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-303</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-427</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-650</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-682</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-939</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-3199</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/fab4e64eedccc73a6fdd974a256c1a8e.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just fighting to survive, you’re fighting to keep the outbreak from reaching the world outside. Every mission is a gamble. How deep will you go?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/087a5e56bdba3a17ed84c821f3dce366.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An SCP containment facility has fallen. Anomalies roam free, reality fractures, and every second drags you deeper into the unknown. You and your team are the last barrier between the outbreak and the outside world.. if you make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/8b8938ce70d85159a77ed9038b58407c.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/8b8938ce70d85159a77ed9038b58407c.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/8b8938ce70d85159a77ed9038b58407c.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/6d01c13330f04a44ec78f131d8815514.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your gear, steel your nerves, and descend into a nightmare that shifts every time you enter. The deeper you push, the richer the rewards… and the greater the risk.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/86f6f7d82f86a18271f4d4abd3732b18.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/86f6f7d82f86a18271f4d4abd3732b18.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/86f6f7d82f86a18271f4d4abd3732b18.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/bf04e66a16f0dc2103739fba340675c6.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run solo for precision and stealth, or bring 2–3 teammates to watch your back. Every firefight is loud enough to wake things you’d rather not meet. Every decision, engage or evade could mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/ce71e89124b4c856b59a505384d87b61.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/ce71e89124b4c856b59a505384d87b61.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/ce71e89124b4c856b59a505384d87b61.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/e55a059f46cc471d431cde1aa55cc039.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, SCP: Outbreak blends surreal brutalist architecture with realistic bodycam-style gunplay. Every bullet has weight. Every wall can crumble. Every shadow could hide something watching.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/afcbc3a98bd4d94c11b4b7eb5e1d4d50.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/afcbc3a98bd4d94c11b4b7eb5e1d4d50.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/afcbc3a98bd4d94c11b4b7eb5e1d4d50.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/854ddaa0a66660d81eefac6f35921014.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, extract, and expand your base to unlock new gear, research SCP artifacts, and prepare for even deadlier missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/685d86c39687b32dbfdb4029ec368344.poster.avif?t=1772277139\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/685d86c39687b32dbfdb4029ec368344.webm?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/685d86c39687b32dbfdb4029ec368344.mp4?t=1772277139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/2f0fe9b37553e0a3f1cbc402d0c53303.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From entities that stalk you in silence to phenomena that twist space itself, no encounter plays out the same way twice. Observe, adapt, or be consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently known SCPs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-049</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-087</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-096</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-106</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-173</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-294</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-303</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-427</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-650</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-682</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-939</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-3199</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/fab4e64eedccc73a6fdd974a256c1a8e.avif?t=1772277139\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just fighting to survive, you’re fighting to keep the outbreak from reaching the world outside. Every mission is a gamble. How deep will you go?</p>", "short_description": "Infiltrate breached SCP facilities in this tactical co-op horror extraction shooter. Survive surreal anomalies, recover forbidden intel, and escape.. or lose everything. The deeper you go, the stranger and deadlier it gets.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Hungarian, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/28e1418b8f61a92bf974c0040e3434a52848602f/header.jpg?t=1772277139", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/782d450e649ad2087e6d6614e760b940cc8b2373/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=177227713